|NOTES
This PushDemo file is an example of a double A-Arm suspension with a push-rod  
between a bell-crank and the lower wishbone.  The spring/shock is attached to  
the bell-crank, which rotates in reaction to movement of the suspension.       
The swaybar is also attached to the bell-crank.                                
This example also includes a halfshaft, but it can also be steered.            
